menu "JetKVM USB debugging"

config JETKVM_USB_DEBUGGING_DEFAULT_ON
    bool "USB debugging is on until the setting is changed (bench builds only)"
    default n
    help
        Without a stored USB debugging setting, keep the USB Serial/JTAG port
        on the Power/EXT connector connected. Bench builds set this option
        (the Dockerfile, with the USB_DEBUGGING build argument that
        tools/combined_load/runner/build.mjs gives), because the bench
        flashes and reads the console over that port. A release leaves it
        off: the port is then off until a user turns USB debugging on, and
        tools/release_config.py refuses a release build with this option.

endmenu
